# Changes to AI guardrails, CI and security config need review from a security owner.
# 1) Replace @your-org/security-team with a real user (@name) or team.
# 2) Enforce it: branch protection -> "Require review from Code Owners".
/.claude/                  @your-org/security-team
/CLAUDE.md                 @your-org/security-team
/.mcp.json                 @your-org/security-team
/.github/                  @your-org/security-team
/.pre-commit-config.yaml   @your-org/security-team
/SECURITY.md               @your-org/security-team
/docs/security-checklist.md        @your-org/security-team
/docs/managed-settings.example.json @your-org/security-team
# Scanner config and suppressions, at any depth.
**/.gitleaks.toml          @your-org/security-team
**/.gitleaksignore         @your-org/security-team
**/osv-scanner.toml        @your-org/security-team
**/.semgrepignore          @your-org/security-team
**/zizmor.yml              @your-org/security-team
**/.zizmor.yml             @your-org/security-team
**/.trivyignore            @your-org/security-team
**/.trivyignore.yaml       @your-org/security-team
**/trivy.yaml              @your-org/security-team
**/trivy-secret.yaml       @your-org/security-team
